{"text": "PRISCILLA GERSBECK\n\nTown Clerk\n\nJune 12, 2019\n\nVanessa Nason\n\nKirsten Santangelo\nDeputy Town Clerk\n\nTOWN OF GOSHEN\n\nMuckrock News\nDept. MR 41390\n\n411A Highland\n\nAvenue\n\nSomerville, MA 02144-2516\n\nRE: _ FOIL dated June 12, 2019\n\nDear Ms. Nason:\n\nThis letter acknowledges, and is in response to, your request to the Town of Goshen, dated June\n12, 2019, pursuant to the N.Y. Public Officers Law \u00a7 84 et seq. (\u201cF.O.1.L.\u201d), in which you have requested:\n\u201cAny and all statistics, data, reports, audits, policies, and procedures pertaining to the following\nitems regarding sexual assault evidence collection (SAEC) kits (also known as \u201crape kits\u201d) and\n\nprocessing:\ne\n\nAll standard operating procedures regarding department practices on the\nacquisition of or handling of rape kit evidence, including protocols for its\ncollection, testing, and delegation and transfer to all other possibly relevant\nlocations, laboratories, or agencies .\nThe number of kits collected and booked into evidence from the period of January\n1, 2000 through the date this request is processed\nThe number of kits that have been processed by a public or private crime or forensic\nlaboratory or equivalent processing location from the period of January 1, 2000 through\nthis request is processed\nThe number of unprocessed kits in any storage facilities currently under the department\u2019s\njurisdiction and control, including those held by medical personnel or at external laboratory\nlocations :\nAny materials regarding the status or ultimate disposition of cases in which a kit was\ncollected. Please include and available segregable date\nAll audits involving this agency regarding the collection or backlog of SAEC kits\n\nThis is a timely response under F.O.LL.\n\nLocation: 41 Webster Avenue, Goshen, New York Mail: P.O. Box 217, Goshen, New York 10924\nTelephone: 845.294.6250 FAX: 845.291.3673 e-mail: PGersbeck@townofgoshen.org",
